usage: analyze_lean_formal_fragment_coverage.py [-h] --archive ARCHIVE
                                                --cpu-library CPU_LIBRARY
                                                --source SOURCE
                                                [--closure-adapter CLOSURE_ADAPTER]
                                                --out OUT

Error analysis of retained complete formal witnesses with the frozen CPU
clone. This reuses an independently checked whole acquisition. It does not
generate candidates, call CUDA, measure GPU performance, or accept any new
proof.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --archive ARCHIVE
  --cpu-library CPU_LIBRARY
  --source SOURCE
  --closure-adapter CLOSURE_ADAPTER
                        isolated changed closure implementation; no CUDA
                        execution
  --out OUT
